  "id": "scalloped-potatoes-with-bacon",
  "name": "Scalloped Potatoes with Bacon",
  "subtitle": "Creamy layered potatoes with bacon and cheese",
  "description": "Tender sliced potatoes are coated in a seasoned creamy mixture, combined with bacon and onion, and baked under a browned cheese topping.",
